{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0082","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000010a:text","row":17942,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"海水浴……か。","en":"A trip to the beach...","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:004800","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028:00001","en":"A beach outing... then.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The source’s reflective “A beach outing... huh” contains no “then.” The added transition implies a conclusion not present.","remedy":"Use “A beach outing... huh.”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":23,"start":0,"text":"A beach outing... then."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000130:text","row":17943,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"美希には悪いけど、思い出にはなった。","en":"I felt bad for Miki, but it had given us a memory.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:004801","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028:00002","en":"Too bad about Miki, but it did become a memory.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000016c:text","row":17944,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"思い出は、心を豊かにしてくれる。","en":"Memories make the heart richer.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:004802","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028:00003","en":"Memories become the abundance of the heart.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","grammar"],"assessment":"The source says memories enrich the heart. “Become the abundance of the heart” is an unnatural nominal calque.","remedy":"Use “Memories enrich the heart.”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":43,"start":0,"text":"Memories become the abundance of the heart."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000300:text","row":17945,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"だから、こんなことも言えてしまう。","en":"Which was why I could say this now.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:004803","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028:00004","en":"And that is why I can say this:","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000342:text","row":17946,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「気にくわないこともあるだろうけど、明日から部活、来てみないか？」","en":"“I know there’s still plenty you don’t like, but... why not start coming to the club tomorrow?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:004804","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028:00005","en":"Taichi: \"I know you can't really stomach it, but couldn't you try coming to Club starting tomorrow?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["overinterpretation","word_choice"],"assessment":"The source allows that there may be things she dislikes. “Can’t really stomach it” intensifies this into strong disgust.","remedy":"Use “There may be things you don’t like, but why not try coming to club tomorrow?”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":100,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"I know you can't really stomach it, but couldn't you try coming to Club starting tomorrow?\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000003c1:text","row":17947,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"「……え？」","en":"“...What?”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:004805","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028:00006","en":"Touko: \"...eh?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000003e5:text","row":17948,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"困惑と戸惑いを貼りつけて、彼女は伏していた顔をあげた。","en":"Touko looked up from the desk, confusion and uncertainty still fixed on her face.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:004806","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028:00007","en":"Gluing puzzlement to bewilderment, she brought up her prostrate head.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","grammar"],"assessment":"The source says she lifts her downturned face with confusion and bewilderment written across it. “Gluing puzzlement to bewilderment” combines the emotions with each other, while “prostrate head” wrongly suggests full bodily prostration.","remedy":"Use “Confusion and bewilderment on her face, she looked up.”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":69,"start":0,"text":"Gluing puzzlement to bewilderment, she brought up her prostrate head."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000433:text","row":17949,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"憔悴したその面差しが、緋色に色づけされてどこか悲壮な印象を与えた。","en":"Her haggard face had gone scarlet, giving her a strangely tragic air.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:004807","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028:00008","en":"Her emaciated features turned a bright scarlet, and left me with an impression in some respects tragic.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["word_choice","mistranslation"],"assessment":"憔悴 describes a haggard or exhausted look, not physical emaciation. The English also awkwardly says the features themselves “left” an impression.","remedy":"Use “Her haggard features flushed scarlet, giving her a strangely tragic look.”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":103,"start":0,"text":"Her emaciated features turned a bright scarlet, and left me with an impression in some respects tragic."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000005f1:text","row":17950,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「……うーむ」","en":"“...Hmm.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00001","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00001","en":"Taichi: \"...mhhh-hm.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000617:text","row":17951,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"夜は原稿書きだ。","en":"Tonight was for writing the script.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00002","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00002","en":"The night is for writing this script.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000063f:text","row":17952,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"いまいちはかどらない。","en":"It wasn’t going well.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00003","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00003","en":"It's progressing in ways unsatisfactory.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000066d:text","row":17953,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"ありきたりな内容。","en":"The material was painfully conventional.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00004","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00004","en":"Content is predictable.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000697:text","row":17954,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"けど、とりあえずは進めておかないと。","en":"Still, I had to press on.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00005","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00005","en":"But, for the time being, I must simply advance it.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000006db:text","row":17955,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「おもしろみに欠けるねぇ」","en":"“It’s pretty dull.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00006","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00006","en":"Taichi: \"This thing's lacking on the fun, innit.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000070d:text","row":17956,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"そうだ。","en":"That was it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00007","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00007","en":"Right!","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000072d:text","row":17957,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"先輩に見てもらうか。","en":"Maybe I should have Misato take a look.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00008","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00008","en":"Should I let Senpai look it over?","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000759:text","row":17958,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"思い立ったが吉日。","en":"No time like the present.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00009","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00009","en":"As the saying goes, the right moment to do things is the moment you think of them.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000783:text","row":17959,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"すぐに家を出た。","en":"I headed out at once.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00010","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00010","en":"I left the house straight away.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000087c:text","row":17960,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"先輩の家だ。","en":"I was at Misato’s house.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00011","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00011","en":"This is Senpai's house.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000008a0:text","row":17961,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"ノックをしてみるが、反応がない。","en":"I knocked, but no one answered.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00012","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00012","en":"I try to knock, but there is no reply.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000008e0:text","row":17962,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「せんぱーい！」","en":"“Misatooo!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00013","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00013","en":"Taichi: \"SENPAAAI!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000908:text","row":17963,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"やはりレスポンスがない。","en":"Still no response.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00014","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00014","en":"As expected, no response.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000940:text","row":17964,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「あなたの太一が来ましたよー！」","en":"“Your Taichi is heeere!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00015","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00015","en":"Taichi: \"Your Taichi has cooome!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000978:text","row":17965,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"シーン","en":"Dead silence.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00016","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00016","en":"Loud silence.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000996:text","row":17966,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"留守かな。","en":"Maybe she was out.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00017","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00017","en":"She absent, maybe?","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000009c0:text","row":17967,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00018","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00018","en":"Taichi: \"...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000009e5:text","row":17968,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"まさか、まだ学校にいる？","en":"She wasn’t still at school... was she?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00019","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00019","en":"Are you kidding me, she's still as school?","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000b02:text","row":17969,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「うわー、いるし！」","en":"“You’ve got to be kidding me—she’s here!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00020","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00020","en":"Taichi: \"Whoooa, she is!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000beb:text","row":17970,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"「わっ、ぺけくん？」","en":"“Ah! Peke?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00021","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00021","en":"Misato: \"Wah, Peke-kun?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000c1f:text","row":17971,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「無茶しすぎ！」","en":"“You’re pushing yourself way too hard!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00022","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00022","en":"Taichi: \"You're pushing yourself way too far!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000ccd:text","row":17972,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「ご、ごめんなさい」","en":"“I-I’m sorry.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00023","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00023","en":"Misato: \"A-, apologies!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000d01:text","row":17973,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「はー」","en":"“Haaah.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00024","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00024","en":"Taichi: \"Sigh...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000d21:text","row":17974,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"例によってというか、アンテナを組み立てていたようだ。","en":"As usual, she was putting the antenna together.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00025","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00025","en":"As is her habit, I should say, she seemed to be assembling the antenna.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000d75:text","row":17975,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「こんな暗くて作業も何もないでしょーが」","en":"“It’s pitch-dark. You can’t possibly work in this.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00026","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00026","en":"Taichi: \"There's no working at all in this pitch black darkness!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000dda:text","row":17976,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「気になっちゃって……ダメですか？」","en":"“I couldn’t stop thinking about it... Is that so bad?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00027","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00027","en":"Misato: \"It worried me... is that bad?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000e1e:text","row":17977,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「ダメ」","en":"“Yes.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00028","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00028","en":"Taichi: \"It's bad.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000e46:text","row":17978,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"「そんなことしてる暇があったら、原稿見てくださいよ」","en":"“If you have time for this, you can read my script.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00029","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00029","en":"Taichi: \"If you have free time to do that, then please check the script.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000f18:text","row":17979,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"「おや、もうできましたか？」","en":"“Oh? You finished it already?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00030","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00030","en":"Misato: \"My, you managed it already?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00000f54:text","row":17980,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「途中です。でも意見聞きたくて」","en":"“Not yet. But I wanted your opinion.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00031","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00031","en":"Taichi: \"It is on the way. But I would still like to hear your opinion.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001012:text","row":17981,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"「あー、でもこう暗いと……読めないですね」","en":"“Ah, but in the dark like this... I can’t read it.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00032","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00032","en":"Misato: \"Ahhh, but with this darkness... I cannot read this.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000105c:text","row":17982,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"「そですね」","en":"“Guess not.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00033","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00033","en":"Taichi: \"So you cannot.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001088:text","row":17983,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"「もういいですから帰りましょう」","en":"“Forget it. We’re going home.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00034","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00034","en":"Taichi: \"Well, this is enough already, so let us head home.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001146:text","row":17984,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、でも……もうちょっと」","en":"“But... just a little longer.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00035","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00035","en":"Misato: \"Ah, but... I still want to...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001182:text","row":17985,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"「みみ先輩……」","en":"“Mimi...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00036","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00036","en":"Taichi: \"Mimi-senpai...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001230:text","row":17986,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"「だってぇ～」","en":"“But I waaant to.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00037","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00037","en":"Misato: \"Buuu～t...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000125e:text","row":17987,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"「焦って進めても、得るものはないんですよ」","en":"“Rushing won’t get you anywhere.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00038","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00038","en":"Taichi: \"If you rush forwards you will not obtain what you want.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001326:text","row":17988,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00039","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00039","en":"Misato: \"...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000134e:text","row":17989,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"「ゆっくりやればいいんです。違いますか？」","en":"“Take it slow. Am I wrong?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00040","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00040","en":"Taichi: \"You would do better to take things slow. Am I wrong?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001398:text","row":17990,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"「時間はたっぷりあるんですから」","en":"“We’ve got plenty of time.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00041","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00041","en":"Taichi: \"Because we have sooo much time still.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000013d8:text","row":17991,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"「それに急げば……それだけはやく終わってしまう」","en":"“And the sooner you finish... the sooner it will all be over.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00042","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00042","en":"Taichi: \"If you hurry this... then this is the only thing that will end faster.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001428:text","row":17992,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"「先輩、それに耐えられるんですか？」","en":"“Can you handle that, Misato?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00043","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00043","en":"Taichi: \"Senpai, would you even be able to stand that?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000014ef:text","row":17993,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"「……っ」","en":"“...!”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00044","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00044","en":"Misato: \"...!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001511:text","row":17994,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"泣きそうな顔。","en":"She looked ready to cry.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00045","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00045","en":"A tearful face.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001537:text","row":17995,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"背筋が痺れた。","en":"My spine went numb.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00046","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00046","en":"My spinal column goes numb.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000155d:text","row":17996,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"つい、自分が禁忌を口走っていたことに気づく。","en":"I realized I’d just let the forbidden thought slip.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00047","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00047","en":"And I realize that, accidentally, I let my mouth run to the taboo.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000015c6:text","row":17997,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"「……わたし、逃げてるんでしょうか」","en":"“...Am I running away?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00048","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00048","en":"Misato: \"...I... I am running away, then?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000160a:text","row":17998,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"「そですね」","en":"“I’d say so.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00049","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00049","en":"Taichi: \"You are.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001653:text","row":17999,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"「そう、見えちゃいますか？」","en":"“Is that how it looks?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00050","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00050","en":"Misato: \"Is it... that noticeable?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000168f:text","row":18000,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"「見えちゃいます」","en":"“I’m afraid it does.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00051","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00051","en":"Taichi: \"It is that noticeable.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000016c1:text","row":18001,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"「作業に没頭することで、逃げてる」","en":"“You’re burying yourself in the work so you don’t have to face it.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00052","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00052","en":"Taichi: \"You are running away by sinking into work.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000016fb:text","row":18002,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"アンテナを見あげる。","en":"I looked up at the antenna.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00053","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00053","en":"I look up at the antenna.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000172f:text","row":18003,"ordinal":62,"kind":"text","jp":"「無理矢理、仕事を作るようにして……わざと手間がかかるやり方で」","en":"“You make up work for yourself... then deliberately choose the slowest way possible.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00054","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00054","en":"Taichi: \"By hook or by crook, you find work to do... and in the most time-consuming way, intentionally.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000180d:text","row":18004,"ordinal":63,"kind":"text","jp":"「……見抜かれてましたか」","en":"“...You figured me out.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00055","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00055","en":"Misato: \"...did you see through me?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001847:text","row":18005,"ordinal":64,"kind":"text","jp":"「それが普通だと思ったんです」","en":"“It seemed perfectly human.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00056","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00056","en":"Taichi: \"I thought it was normal.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001903:text","row":18006,"ordinal":65,"kind":"text","jp":"「え？」","en":"“What?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00057","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00057","en":"Misato: \"Eh?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000193d:text","row":18007,"ordinal":66,"kind":"text","jp":"「先輩のしていることは、そうおかしなことじゃない」","en":"“What you’re doing isn’t that unusual.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00058","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00058","en":"Taichi: \"If Senpai was doing it, it couldn't be that strange.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000198f:text","row":18008,"ordinal":67,"kind":"text","jp":"「逃避をしたことのない人間なんていませんよ」","en":"“Everyone runs away sometimes.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00059","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00059","en":"Taichi: \"There is no such thing as a human who has never run away!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000019db:text","row":18009,"ordinal":68,"kind":"text","jp":"「けど先輩みたいに、必死に逃避しなければならないのは……つらいことだ」","en":"“But having to run from things as desperately as you do... that has to hurt.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00060","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00060","en":"Taichi: \"But to be like you, Senpai, being unable to do anything but run away as if your life depended on it... that is heart-breaking.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001a41:text","row":18010,"ordinal":69,"kind":"text","jp":"「もちません、心は」","en":"“Your heart can only take so much.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00061","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00061","en":"Taichi: \"It can't last, that heart of yours.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001af3:text","row":18011,"ordinal":70,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“............”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00062","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00062","en":"Misato: \"......\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001b1f:text","row":18012,"ordinal":71,"kind":"text","jp":"「あなたは……３０を越えているはずだ」","en":"“You must be... above thirty.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00063","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00063","en":"Taichi: \"You... must've gone above 30 by now.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001b82:text","row":18013,"ordinal":72,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“............”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00064","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00064","en":"Misato: \"......\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001bae:text","row":18014,"ordinal":73,"kind":"text","jp":"「強度の自傷症状」","en":"“Severe symptoms of self-harm.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00065","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00065","en":"Taichi: \"Symptoms: intense self-injury.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001bfd:text","row":18015,"ordinal":74,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“............”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00066","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00066","en":"Misato: \"......\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001c21:text","row":18016,"ordinal":75,"kind":"text","jp":"無言という肯定。","en":"Her silence was answer enough.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00067","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00067","en":"A silence called assent.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001c49:text","row":18017,"ordinal":76,"kind":"text","jp":"俺はただ、言葉を重ねる。","en":"I just kept talking.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00068","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00068","en":"I merely kept piling word on word.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001c81:text","row":18018,"ordinal":77,"kind":"text","jp":"「一人で作業するのはいい。けど追いつめられているなら……このまま単独で没頭するのは危険だ」","en":"“Working by yourself is fine. But if you’re already cornered... losing yourself in it alone like this is dangerous.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00069","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00069","en":"Taichi: \"Hard labor on your own is fine. But letting yourself be cornered by it... you keep sinking into this on your own, that's dangerous.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001cfb:text","row":18019,"ordinal":78,"kind":"text","jp":"「……弾けたとき、ここが屋上だってことが、危険だ」","en":"“...And if you snap, being up here on the roof makes it more dangerous still.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00070","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00070","en":"Taichi: \"...when that explodes, you being here on this rooftop is dangerous.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001d4d:text","row":18020,"ordinal":79,"kind":"text","jp":"「わかってますか？」","en":"“Do you understand?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00071","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00071","en":"Taichi: \"Do you understand this?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001d9e:text","row":18021,"ordinal":80,"kind":"text","jp":"「わかって、ますよ」","en":"“I... understand.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00072","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00072","en":"Misato: \"I under... stand.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001dca:text","row":18022,"ordinal":81,"kind":"text","jp":"ぽつ、と言う。","en":"She murmured.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00073","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00073","en":"Fragmentary, to say.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001df8:text","row":18023,"ordinal":82,"kind":"text","jp":"「たいへん心配です」","en":"“I’m very worried about you.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00074","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00074","en":"Taichi: \"This is a really big worry for me.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001e24:text","row":18024,"ordinal":83,"kind":"text","jp":"先輩は眼鏡を外した。","en":"Misato took off her glasses.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00075","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00075","en":"Senpai took off her glasses.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001e50:text","row":18025,"ordinal":84,"kind":"text","jp":"涙ぐんだ瞳に、指の背を添える。","en":"She pressed the back of a finger to her tearful eyes.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00076","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00076","en":"The back of her fingers accompany themselves to her tear-filled eyes.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001f0c:text","row":18026,"ordinal":85,"kind":"text","jp":"「ぺけくんに、心配されるくらい……不安定だったんですね、わたし」","en":"“I must be pretty unstable... if even you’re worried about me, Peke.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00077","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00077","en":"Misato: \"I make even you worry, Peke-kun... I am so unstable, that is why.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001f6c:text","row":18027,"ordinal":86,"kind":"text","jp":"「はは……その言い方は、失礼だなあ」","en":"“Hah... That’s a pretty rude way to put it.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00078","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00078","en":"Taichi: \"Hahah... saying it that way's a bit impolite!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00001fcd:text","row":18028,"ordinal":87,"kind":"text","jp":"「あはは」","en":"“Ahaha.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00079","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00079","en":"Misato: \"Ahahah!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00002014:text","row":18029,"ordinal":88,"kind":"text","jp":"「君にこんなこと言われるなんてびっくりしました」","en":"“I never thought I’d hear that from you.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00080","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00080","en":"Misato: \"But I am surprised at you telling me this.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000205c:text","row":18030,"ordinal":89,"kind":"text","jp":"涙をぬぐう。","en":"She wiped away her tears.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00081","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00081","en":"She wipes her tears.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00002106:text","row":18031,"ordinal":90,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ありがとう」","en":"“...Thank you.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00082","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00082","en":"Misato: \"...thank you.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00002138:text","row":18032,"ordinal":91,"kind":"text","jp":"「いいえ」","en":"“You’re welcome.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00083","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00083","en":"Taichi: \"'s nothing.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000217f:text","row":18033,"ordinal":92,"kind":"text","jp":"「だって……みんなバラバラで……このまま霧散するみたいで」","en":"“It’s just... everyone’s scattered... and it feels like we’re going to dissolve.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00084","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00084","en":"Misato: \"But... we are broken up and scattered around here and there... soon, it will be as if we had all vanished into the fog.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000021d9:text","row":18034,"ordinal":93,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺は霧散してないですよ」","en":"“I haven’t dissolved.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00085","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00085","en":"Taichi: \"I will not vanish into the fog!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00002291:text","row":18035,"ordinal":94,"kind":"text","jp":"「だって、君はなんだか……動機が不純」","en":"“But your motives are kind of... impure.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00086","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00086","en":"Misato: \"But you have... less than pure motives, so to say.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000022cf:text","row":18036,"ordinal":95,"kind":"text","jp":"ばれてた。","en":"Busted.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00087","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00087","en":"Exposed.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000022f9:text","row":18037,"ordinal":96,"kind":"text","jp":"「まあ」","en":"“Well.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00088","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00088","en":"Taichi: \"Well.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000239f:text","row":18038,"ordinal":97,"kind":"text","jp":"「でも確かにわたし、意固地になっていたのかも」","en":"“Still, maybe I was just being stubborn.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00089","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00089","en":"Misato: \"But it is true that I have become obstinate, perhaps.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000023ed:text","row":18039,"ordinal":98,"kind":"text","jp":"「それに厳密には一人じゃないみたいですよ？」","en":"“And strictly speaking, it seems you weren’t alone.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00090","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00090","en":"Taichi: \"Besides, strictly speaking it seems you were not alone, you know?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000024b7:text","row":18040,"ordinal":99,"kind":"text","jp":"「え？」","en":"“What?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00091","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00091","en":"Misato: \"Eh?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000024df:text","row":18041,"ordinal":100,"kind":"text","jp":"「これ」","en":"“This.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00092","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00092","en":"Taichi: \"Here.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000024ff:text","row":18042,"ordinal":101,"kind":"text","jp":"先ほど、給水塔の下でひろった包みを見せる。","en":"I showed her the package I’d found beneath the water tower earlier.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00093","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00093","en":"I show her the parcel that I found earlier at the foot of the water tower.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000025c7:text","row":18043,"ordinal":102,"kind":"text","jp":"「差し入れ？」","en":"“A care package?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00094","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00094","en":"Misato: \"A supply drop?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000025f5:text","row":18044,"ordinal":103,"kind":"text","jp":"「イエス」","en":"“Yep.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00095","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00095","en":"Taichi: \"Yess'uh.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000261f:text","row":18045,"ordinal":104,"kind":"text","jp":"「ただし中身はカレーパン」","en":"“Though it’s only curry bread.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00096","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00096","en":"Taichi: \"However, contents are curry bread.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000026d7:text","row":18046,"ordinal":105,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………あ」","en":"“............Oh.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00097","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00097","en":"Misato: \"......ah!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000026fd:text","row":18047,"ordinal":106,"kind":"text","jp":"気づいて、口元を押さえる。","en":"She realized what it was and covered her mouth.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00098","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00098","en":"Realizing, she pins down her mouth.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00002737:text","row":18048,"ordinal":107,"kind":"text","jp":"「あいつも最近、ちょっとナーバスみたいでなかなか顔見せないですけど、ね」","en":"“He’s been a little on edge lately, so he hasn’t shown his face much. But still...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00099","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00099","en":"Taichi: \"Lately, that guy seemed nervous enough that he would just not show face either, right.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000279f:text","row":18049,"ordinal":108,"kind":"text","jp":"「あのバカ、自分の仲間が追い込まれるの、見てられない性格してますから」","en":"“That idiot can’t stand watching one of his own get backed into a corner.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00100","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00100","en":"Taichi: \"That idiot, he has the kind of personality that just cannot stand even looking at close friends being driven into a corner.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00002805:text","row":18050,"ordinal":109,"kind":"text","jp":"「こんな傷みかけのカレーパン持ってきて」","en":"“And he brings you curry bread that’s already starting to go bad.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00101","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00101","en":"Taichi: \"And he brought you some near-spoiling curry bread.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000028cb:text","row":18051,"ordinal":110,"kind":"text","jp":"「でもぺけくん、嬉しそう」","en":"“But you look happy, Peke.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00102","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00102","en":"Misato: \"But you seem happy, Peke-kun.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:00002905:text","row":18052,"ordinal":111,"kind":"text","jp":"「食べます？」","en":"“Want some?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00103","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00103","en":"Taichi: \"Shall we eat?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:0000298c:text","row":18053,"ordinal":112,"kind":"text","jp":"先輩は小さくうなずいた。","en":"Misato gave a small nod.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00104","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00104","en":"Senpai made a tiny nods.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0082:000029bc:text","row":18054,"ordinal":113,"kind":"text","jp":"二人で、カレーパンを食べた。","en":"We ate the curry bread together.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00105","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0028b:00105","en":"We ate curry bread, the two of us.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]}]}
